==Battleground==
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Master A.]] spawns as the boss.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**1 [[Kory]] spawns as the boss.
*When the base reaches 70% HP:
**1 [[Metal One Horn]] spawns as the boss.
*When the base reaches 60% HP:
**1 [[Director Kurosawah]] spawns as the boss.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
**1 [[Bore]] spawns as the boss.
*When the base reaches 40% HP:
**1 [[Camelle]] spawns as the boss.
*When the base reaches 30% HP:
**1 [[R.Ost]] spawns as the boss.
*When the base reaches 20% HP:
**1 [[Boraphim]] spawns as the boss.
*When the base reaches 10% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
It's the final(?) showdown, Nyanko. But despite this, it isn't too difficult to handle these enemies individually; bring [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] as general attackers, [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] for Kory and Teacher Bun Bun, and a Critter like [[Cheerleader Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Waitress Cat]] for the Metal One Horn. Aside from them, [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]] should cover the rest of your bases, leaving only two problematic encounters here.

You will want to bring either three meatshields or [[Ancient Egg: N001 (Special Cat)|Haniwa Cat]] for R.Ost specifically, and counter him with your generic midrangers like [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]]. Finally, Boraphim (and by extension Teacher Bun Bun) can be subdued with a stack of [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cats]]. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] is a good choice for speeding up each individual encounter. If you are using ubers, you should use them after Director Kurosawah dies as he can nuke your ubers. [[Sniper the Recruit (Super Rare Cat)|Sniper the Deadeye]] is also very good in this stage as he can serve as crowd-control for all the bosses except the Metal One Horn, who shouldn't be much trouble anyway.

